:"ENSG00000105290","module":"brown","kme":0.377863,"hub":false,"module_direction":"higher in AD","module_padj":0.552322,"module_significant":false},{"cell_type":"Mic","gene_id":"ENSG00000105290","module":"turquoise","kme":0.123417,"hub":false,"module_direction":"lower in AD","module_padj":0.398013,"module_significant":false},{"cell_type":"OPC","gene_id":"ENSG00000105290","module":"turquoise","kme":0.0607713,"hub":false,"module_direction":"higher in AD","module_padj":0.680759,"module_significant":false},{"cell_type":"Oli","gene_id":"ENSG00000105290","module":"turquoise","kme":0.383507,"hub":false,"module_direction":"higher in AD","module_padj":0.842971,"module_significant":false}],"degas_bulk_de":false,"drug_target":false}},"description":[{"gene_id":"ENSG00000105290","entrez_id":["333"],"uniprot":["P51693"],"ncbi_summary":"This gene encodes a member of the highly conserved amyloid precursor protein gene family. The encoded protein is a membrane-associated glycoprotein that is cleaved by secretases in a manner similar to amyloid beta A4 precursor protein cleavage. This cleavage liberates an intracellular cytoplasmic fragment that may act as a transcriptional activator. The encoded protein may also play a role in synaptic maturation during cortical development. Alternatively spliced transcript variants encoding different isoforms have been described. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2008].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"P51693","text":"May play a role in postsynaptic function. The C-terminal gamma-secretase processed fragment, ALID1, activates transcription activation through APBB1 (Fe65) binding (By similarity). Couples to JIP signal transduction through C-terminal binding. May interact with cellular G protein signaling pathways. Can regulate neurite outgrowth through binding to components of the extracellular matrix such as heparin and collagen I. The gamma-CTF peptide, C30, is a potent enhancer of neuronal apoptosis."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}